        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_ca48478dc064492195ba2b578555c450",
      "statement": "The webapp image bakes NEXT_PUBLIC_* values into the client bundle at build time via Docker ARG/ENV before `npm run build`, producing a Next.js standalone server on port 3001, so changing them requires an image rebuild.",
