      "statement": "The production and staging compose files are identical except that staging mounts DEV_SECRETS_HOST_PATH at /secrets with DEV_SECRETS_DIR and AWS Secrets Manager disabled; both use registry-tagged images, no bind mounts and the RedBeat scheduler for celery-beat, while the dev compose builds :dev images with source bind mounts, hot reload, a host Postgres via host.docker.internal and published Redis ports.",
