      "statement": "All compose stacks run two Redis instances (one for backend Celery, one for ai-llm-service), a backend group with `default`, `canvas_dbt` and `alerts` Celery workers plus beat, a Prefect group where prefect-server, prefect-proxy and the workers reuse the proxy image, and an ai-llm API plus Celery worker on the `llm` queue; production and staging add a `dailybackup` worker that dev lacks.",
