      "id": "claim_f73d51c3ce8243e19995cb464a457369",
      "statement": "Compose files carry only container-networking overrides (hostnames, ports, broker URLs) in `environment`; application configuration is read from each service's own .env file, and image registry/tags are parameterized by REGISTRY and *_IMAGE_TAG variables that the deploy workflows override. CLIENTDBT_ROOT_MOUNT must be the same path on host and container because paths are stored absolutely.",
