    {
      "id": "claim_c6f5f79a787a44999accb5ab3cab55cf",
      "statement": "The OpenWiki update workflow runs daily and on dispatch with full git history, installs openwiki@0.7.2 with mermaid and jsdom on Node 22, runs `openwiki code --update --print` with continue-on-error using Anthropic provider configuration (ANTHROPIC_API_KEY secret, model id, telemetry disabled, no LangSmith keys), then opens or refreshes a PR on branch openwiki/update staging openwiki, AGENTS.md, the workflow file and CLAUDE.md only when present, and finally fails the job if OpenWiki failed, so partial progress is preserved in the PR.",
